### Create vehicle
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleNo": "WB01AB1234",
  "seats": 4,
  "startPoint": "Kolkata",
  "finalStop": "Durgapur",
  "cost": 800,
  "discount": 50
}

### Create ride
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerEmail": "owner@example.com",
  "vehicleNo": "WB01AB1234",
  "seats": 4,
  "startPoint": "Kolkata",
  "stop1": "Burdwan",
  "finalStop": "Durgapur",
  "cost": 800,
  "discount": 50,
  "date": "2026-09-20"
}

### Search rides
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rides/search?from=Kolkata&to=Durgapur&date=2026-09-20

### Book seats
POST http://localhost:8080/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rideId": 1,
  "passengerEmail": "passenger@example.com",
  "startLocation": "Kolkata",
  "destination": "Durgapur",
  "seats": 2,
  "date": "2026-09-20"
}
